Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.76,0:02:37.80,Default-1,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn方正兰亭黑Pro GBK Medium\fs6\bord0\c&H747D73&fax0.3\frz1\pos(554.83,205.48)}四眼医生
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.80,0:02:37.84,Default-1,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn方正兰亭黑Pro GBK Medium\fs6\bord0\c&H747D73&fax0.3\frz1\pos(554.82,205.49)}四眼医生
